      "artist": "Soica2001 (talk)",
      "description": "The Longest outside Bench in Parliamentary Constitutional Monarchy of Japan/Asia is placed near town of Shika, Prefecture of Ishikawa, Japan. The whole length of the wooden and concrete construction is exactly/precisely 406.00 meters long.\nThe longest \"alpine/mountain\" bench in the world is placed in Swiss Canton of Appenzell, over the village of Jakobsbad AI. It's starting point is located a very next to the Kronberg 1663.00 meters over the sea level and the length of the pure wooden construction is exactly/precisely  1013.32 meters. The entire constructive process was done by the world famous company APPENZELLER KAESSE GMbH AI , as a present to the worldcommers from all over the world.\n\nThe longest bench of the world in the category \"town/city\" is executed by ARCHITECT DIMITAR BOYUKLIEV in Town of Pazardzik, Republic of Bulgaria. There can sit at one time more than 2020 persons. The full length of the Pazardzik's bench is exactly/precisely 1015 meters long.",
